// 014.6b (#71): if `Migrates` violates an `Entrenched Invariant` on the migrated state,
// the amendment is rejected with CHR051 and neither the law change nor the migration commits.
//! expect-error: CHR051
Fact member Identified by Alice.
Function balance Identified by member * int.

Entrenched Invariant nonnegative-balance When
  (Forall balance: balance.int >= 0).

Amend bad-migration Actor member
  Holds when True
  Valid when True
  Migrates {
    Creates (Foreach balance: balance(balance.member, balance.int - 500)).
  }.

+balance(Alice, 100).
bad-migration(Alice).
?balance(Alice, 100).
